GR-DOS help: type HELP and a topic, such as HELP START or HELP XCOPY.
Topics marked * are GR-DOS's own; the others are MS-DOS 4.00's.

Guides
  BATCH         Batch files: running a list of commands, with parameters
  CODEPAGE      How code page switching fits together
  DIST16      * The *16 programs in C:\DOS, from the gr-dos GitHub projects
  FLOPPY      * Using GR-DOS from a floppy, with your data in B:
  GRDOS       * What GR-DOS adds to MS-DOS 4.00, and its licenses
  HARDDISK    * Installing GR-DOS on a hard disk or CF card
  START       * Getting started with GR-DOS

Commands (programs)
  APPEND        Lets programs open data files in other directories
  ASSIGN        Sends the requests for one drive to another drive
  ATTRIB        Shows or changes the read-only and archive attributes of
                 files
  BACKUP        Backs up files to floppies or another disk, for RESTORE
  CHKDSK        Checks a disk's directories and FAT, and shows its free space
  COMMAND       The command interpreter, COMMAND.COM: the prompt and batch
                 files
  COMP          Compares files byte by byte
  DEBUG         Tests, changes and assembles programs, and edits memory and
                 disks
 INDEX  Line 1  WRAP  Q quit
